=== 3. T8b -- EVERY CHANNEL'S CO2 and d13C CONTRIBUTION and its EFFECTIVE SIGNATURE ===
  dCO2, dd13C = base - knockout (vectors), peak-to-peak. sig_proj = (dd13 . dCO2)/|dCO2|^2,
  permil per ppm, SIGNED (negative = d13C falls as CO2 rises: a depleted source). sig_mag =
  |dd13|/|dCO2|. 'off-antiphase' = months between dd13 and -dCO2 (0 = a signed scalar).
  d13C-only channels (|dCO2| < 1e-3) report the d13C vector alone.

